olCallId":"call_h5SQm8FIRvgMqGyOcmvEsxjh|fc_00a222b7af186d75016a953aa92be887d2b73bec5638cf5f72","toolName":"todo","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Remaining items (2):\n  - Re-run integration test suite [in_progress] (Verification)\n  - Write interface fix report [pending] (Verification)\nOverall: 4/6 done, 2 open.\nActive phase 3/3 \"Verification\" (0/2).\n  Diagnosis:\n    - [X] Run integration test suite\n    - [X] Inspect catalog orders reports interfaces\n  Repair:\n    - [X] Update consumers for Money and legacy prices\n    - [X] Preserve mixed-currency validation\n  Verification:\n    - [ ] Re-run integration test suite (in progress)\n    - [ ] Write interface fix report"}],"details":{"op":"done","phases":[{"name":"Diagnosis","tasks":[{"content":"Run integration test suite","status":"completed"},{"content":"Inspect catalog orders reports interfaces","status":"completed"}]},{"name":"Repair","tasks":[{"content":"Update consumers for Money and legacy prices","status":"completed"},{"content":"Preserve mixed-currency validation","status":"completed"}]},{"name":"Verification","tasks":[{"content":"Re-run integration test suite","status":"in_progress"},{"content":"Write interface fix report","status":"pending"}]}],"storage":"memory","completedTasks":[{"phase":"Repair","content":"Preserve mixed-currency validation"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788164778196},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_00a222b7af186d75016a953aab665087d291c844bc2ac16d7c\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"fcc35639-fc1e-41d3-81a4-70b1d457b66e\"},\"summary\":[],\"metadata\":{\"turn_id\":\"fcc35639-fc1e-41d3-81a4-70b1d457b66e\"}}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_Kl264v5JAjqaJCIrzEA3b1l5|fc_00a222b7af186d75016a953aabe35887d2b3addeda5926945c","name":"write","arguments":{"i":"Write interface repair report","path":"/workspace/out/interface_fix_report.md","content":"# Interface Fix Report\n\n## Root cause\n\n`catalog.Product` now stores its price in a `Money` object (`product.price.amount_cents` and `product.price.currency`). The `orders` adapter still read the removed `product.price_cents` and `product.currency` attributes. As a result, order pricing failed for current `Product` instances, and currency lookup could incorrectly fall back to USD. The reports package delegates pricing to `orders`, so it inherited the same breakage.\n\n## Changed files\n\n- `in/shopmono/packages/orders/orders/adapter.py`\n  - Read `amount_cents` and `currency` from the current nested Money price.\n  - Retain support for legacy dictionaries containing `price_cents` and optional top-level `currency`.\n  - Also support dictionary representations with nested `price.amount_cents` and `price.currency`.\n- `out/interface_fix_report.md`\n  - Added this root-cause, change, and verification record.\n\n`catalog` was not changed; the `Money` model remains the source-of-truth price representation. `orders.service.price_order` still rejects mixed currencies with `ValueError(\"mixed currencies are not supported\")`.\n\n## Verification\n\nRequested command:\n\n```text\npython -m pytest tests\n```\n\nThe supplied absolute macOS path is not mounted in this environment. From the available checkout at `/workspace/in/shopmono`, `python` is unavailable and `python3 -m pytest tests` cannot run because pytest is not installed.\n\nA direct Python smoke check was run from `/workspace/in/shopmono` with the package paths configured. It verified:\n\n- current `Product`/`Money` order totals;\n- report aggregation by USD and EUR;\n- legacy `price_cents` dictionaries;\n- nested dictionary Money representations; and\n- rejection of a mixed-currency order with an error containing `mixed`.\n\nCommand used:\n\n```text\nPYTHONPATH=packages/catalog:packages/orders:packages/reports python3 -c '...compatibility and mixed-currency assertions...'\n```\n"},"intent":"Write interface repair report"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":867,"output":502,"cacheRead":22272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23641,"reasoningTokens":18,"cost":{"input":0.0001734,"output":0.0006024,"cacheRead":0.00044544,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00122124}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788164778222,"responseId":"resp_00a222b7af186d75016a953aaa91dc87d2a0c55511cf19d0ca","duration":10403.724599000008,"ttft":1225.3223440000002},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Kl264v5JAjqaJCIrzEA3b1l5|fc_00a222b7af186d75016a953aabe35887d2b3addeda5926945c","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[out/interface_fix_report.md#15F7]\nSuccessfully wrote 1922 bytes to out/interface_fix_report.md"}],"details":{"resolvedPath":"/workspace/out/interface_fix_report.md"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788164788671},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_00a222b7af186d75016a953ab55f6887d29b7b0680fa3ef588\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"fcc35639-fc1e-41d3-81a4-70b1d457b66e\"},\"summary\":[],\"metadata\":{\"turn_id\":\"fcc35639-fc1e-41d3-81a4-70b1d457b66e\"}}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_v6VzLOq78BrXQ9VOE4ihHXbe|fc_00a222b7af186d75016a953ab6639c87d2b8c82b215eaa2e30","name":"todo","arguments":{"i":"Record verification limits","op":"done","list":null,"task":"Re-run integration test suite","phase":null,"items":null,"reason":null},"intent":"Record verification limits"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":1401,"output":98,"cacheRead":22272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23771,"reasoningTokens":49,"cost":{"input":0.00028020000000000003,"output":0.0001176,"cacheRead":0.00044544,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0008432400000000001}},"stopReaso